{"title":"Ghoulish Goods","slug":"Ghoulish_Goods","hero":null,"pageid":1800,"revid":15912,"timestamp":"2024-11-23T01:20:10Z","lastEditor":"AEUNOR","categories":["Events","Locations"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay Island"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Sells Halloween Goods"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.40.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"7/10/2023"},{"label":"NPC","value":"Headless Horseman"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Ghoulish Goods</b> is a store that was added during the Halloween 2023 update. It sells various exclusive Halloween items, which include gifts, decorations and <span data-unresolved=\"1\">Vinyls</span>. It is owned and run by the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Headless_Horseman/\">Headless Horseman</a>. \n</p>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store. \n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Tombstone/\">Tombstone</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Grave\">Grave</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>575 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Halloween Balloons</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Hwballons\">Hwballons</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>940 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Cauldron/\">Cauldron</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Cauldron\">Cauldron</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>1,660 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pumpkin/\">Pumpkin</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Orangepum\">Orangepum</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>822 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Green_Pumpkin/\">Green Pumpkin</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Greenpum\">Greenpum</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>1,040 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gift_of_Edentulus/\">Gift of Edentulus</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Skullgift\">Skullgift</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>2,499 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gift_of_Membri/\">Gift of Membri</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gift of Membri\">Gift of Membri</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>4,199 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fallen_Fortress/\">Fallen Fortress</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Fortress\">Fortress</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>3,666 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hallow_Woods/\">Hallow Woods</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Hallowwood\">Hallowwood</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>6,660 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>The eye at the top of the shop always stares at the players camera position.</li>\n<li>The buyable <span data-unresolved=\"1\">Vinyls</span>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fallen_Fortress/\">Fallen Fortress</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hallow_Woods/\">Hallow Woods</a>, will apply a fog effect on anybody who is on the plot while the Vinyl is playing.</li>\n<li>When the shop is approached fog will appear and the <span data-unresolved=\"1\">Vinyl</span> <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fallen_Fortress/\">Fallen Fortress</a> will start playing.</li></ul>"}
